    narr:narration """[The core-feature thesis](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) frames the differentiator this hub organizes around, set down first. Months later, three team-voiced updates land close together: [a shipped-widget report](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789205548941_1), [a velocity claim](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789205548941_2), and [an integration credit](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789205548941_3), all from the same speaker on the same day. Alongside them sits [a driver-focused frame](narr:Position_SprintExecutionDrivers) posed as a question rather than answered — a place where support could sit but has not yet been supplied. The sequence reads as thesis-then-evidence, though the evidence so far is self-reported and undated against the thesis's own framing.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789205548941_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789205548941_2> ;
